OL,3,GNEWSATwo arrests as man dies following
OL,4,Amotorbike crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 21-year-old man has died nearly a
OL,7,Fweek after being seriously injured in a
OL,8,Fcrash involving two motorbikes.
OL,10,FThames Valley Police said officers were
OL,11,Fcalled to the collision on Vastern Road
OL,12,Fin Reading at about 02:15 BST on 26
OL,13,FSeptember. It said one of the bikes was
OL,14,Fbelieved to have a rider and a
OL,15,Fpassenger.
OL,17,FThe injured man, from the Berkshire
OL,18,Ftown, died in hospital on Friday, said
OL,19,Fthe force. His next of kin have been
OL,20,Finformed.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
